#: templates/channels/detail.html:99
msgid ""
"Both of these can only be set after the channel exists, because the webhook "
"URL above contains its id, so you create the endpoint in your provider "
"first, then paste back what it gives you. Until the relevant one is set, "
"bounce and complaint notifications are ignored rather than trusted."
